{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:755f1d5ed21884dd603e672c079c3ab14300986229b0f7944f90d66bef52d484",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fe792f1618675c8e2a4e624e72a2ee22b457de15628bad09dae9b05ee4e5477",
      "text": "（至今为止一直，全身心投入格斗技。\n然而，如今却化为乌有了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d16b186069ed81f8f1053f9c6fe2b88f00fa11aba7ea408616f084d7f9aff2",
      "text": "（从今往后，我该怎么办才好……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bf3849c106847c107ebd8f0406d4a8439ac6f1f1acf5cffa8d27150fa0514bf",
      "text": "好咧，久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb56966c013513628bba4c765b1925f0268731ec69d2fc641a1b2fccb16ed0c",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n我开动了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45ab9474322dd2a4bc5fd837f9f68614e21a063a1ce8d3db7cf1bed0d6d3685",
      "text": "嗯？怎么停筷子了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90bb3258d0560ff0c784509ae952908b834d14cf0ae8fc1c24db690ece90f8e7",
      "text": "……好吃。\n我从来没吃过这么好吃的拉面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf6e7c19ce6340fd0514f87b603e0600923381bb6890aa2c81d851cbcc1909e3",
      "text": "奇怪？因为太好吃了，不知怎么眼泪流下来了……\n嘿嘿，很奇怪对吧……可是，真的……太好吃了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f44b93f4ba79c82f2010f868a444fa6ef77254469a14c39052a8b8c4a213a44",
      "text": "……我们店里的拉面啊，\n越是拼命努力过的家伙，越是觉得好吃哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:005123b446780c231eb6057fb47e4912deea1b6136e6624cf7719945222d8fb7",
      "text": "（这个味道，是对至今为止的努力……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6d49ba5ed96ef31a9028eb5043768a5302dee03b82b0b0934fe6eecea858efa",
      "text": "（……啊啊，原来如此。我所做过的事情，\n绝不是毫无意义的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db19ab7207723dcff3cc765fd58d3b8b68ca2c91d592945ba043c4ae4ef5ba01",
      "text": "……嘿嘿，真是吃多少碗都还想吃的味道呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee49d93d461401fa0deabe7434f4265352e370a6a2a2410f8fc078deada08f4",
      "text": "老板，再来一碗！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
